{"4110670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Veinrider", "steam_appid": 4110670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Veinrider</strong> is an incremental game where you upgrade a gravity-flipping mining craft and navigate through the caves of an alien world. Each run yields more resources you can invest into permanent upgrades, turning your fragile rig into an unstoppable mining juggernaut.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110670/extras/381dbc83bea8dde629d672197d8ac99a.poster.avif?t=1787568405\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110670/extras/381dbc83bea8dde629d672197d8ac99a.webm?t=1787568405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110670/extras/381dbc83bea8dde629d672197d8ac99a.mp4?t=1787568405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>♦ Upgrade your ship</strong>: mine resources, trade them in, and steadily improve your ship’s shields, weapons, and systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>♦ Satisfying controls</strong>: simple gravity-flip controls inspired by classics—easy to pick up, deep to master</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>♦ Procedural Terrain</strong>: every time you play, the alien caverns are different </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110670/extras/71fffa3e1f84035e3d0b8fbe6714017c.poster.avif?t=1787568405\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110670/extras/71fffa3e1f84035e3d0b8fbe6714017c.webm?t=1787568405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110670/extras/71fffa3e1f84035e3d0b8fbe6714017c.mp4?t=1787568405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig, upgrade, and push deeper—until the planet gives up all it has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110670/extras/7b18db2cdd6711d3bdf9c58c9cc788e6.poster.avif?t=1787568405\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110670/extras/7b18db2cdd6711d3bdf9c58c9cc788e6.webm?t=1787568405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110670/extras/7b18db2cdd6711d3bdf9c58c9cc788e6.mp4?t=1787568405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110670/extras/ba03bdf9d44690f79151d8f290763f36.avif?t=1787568405\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110670/extras/b1ec20e4273ab66dc1c89e18d5f13131.poster.avif?t=1787568405\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110670/extras/b1ec20e4273ab66dc1c89e18d5f13131.webm?t=1787568405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4110670/extras/b1ec20e4273ab66dc1c89e18d5f13131.mp4?t=1787568405\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Veinrider</strong> is an incremental game